stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LISTENING: bot starts
    
    LISTENING --> REACTION_DETECTED: messageReactionAdd
    REACTION_DETECTED --> CHECK_SELF: userId === botId?
    CHECK_SELF --> LISTENING: YES (ignore our own reactions)
    
    CHECK_SELF --> CHECK_OWN_MSG: message.author.id === client.user.id?
    CHECK_OWN_MSG --> LISTENING: NO (not our message)
    
    CHECK_OWN_MSG --> CHECK_CHANNEL: message.channel instanceof TextChannel?
    CHECK_CHANNEL --> LISTENING: NO (DM, group)
    
    CHECK_CHANNEL --> HANDLE_CMD: handleReactionCommand()

    HANDLE_CMD --> LOOKUP_CMD: reactionCommands[emojiName]
    LOOKUP_CMD --> UNKNOWN_CMD: unknown emoji
    UNKNOWN_CMD --> LISTENING: return without action
    
    LOOKUP_CMD --> STOP_CMD: stop
    LOOKUP_CMD --> START_CMD: start
    LOOKUP_CMD --> CLEAR_CMD: clear

    STOP_CMD --> RESET_LLM1: resetLLM()
    RESET_LLM1 --> CLEAR_COOLDOWN1: clearCooldown(channelId)
    CLEAR_COOLDOWN1 --> TRACK1: trackSpeaker(channelId, userId)
    TRACK1 --> PAUSE: setPaused(true)
    PAUSE --> REACT_OK

    START_CMD --> UNPAUSE: setPaused(false)
    UNPAUSE --> REACT_OK

    CLEAR_CMD --> RESET_LLM2: resetLLM()
    RESET_LLM2 --> CLEAR_COOLDOWN2: clearCooldown(channelId)
    CLEAR_COOLDOWN2 --> TRACK2: trackSpeaker(channelId, userId)
    TRACK2 --> REACT_OK

    REACT_OK --> ADD_CHECK: message.addReaction(":white_check_mark:")
    ADD_CHECK --> LISTENING: return listening

    note right of RESET_LLM1: resetLLM() empties the request queue, resets the LLM context
    note right of TRACK1: trackSpeaker() records the user as the last speaker (for follow-up)
